@@ BE8 | Agile
The cloud provider announces a 30% price increase. What should the product owner do?
A) Assess the cost impact and options, such as optimisation or alternative providers
B) Accept the increase, since moving to another provider is never possible
C) Move to another provider immediately, without assessing the effort involved
D) Pass the full increase on to customers straight away, without considering the effects
= A
? Market changes are analysed for their impact on cost and value, and options are compared before deciding.

@@ BE8 | Hybrid
New visa rules are expected to reduce international student enrolments by 20%. What should the project manager do?
A) Reassess the business case and adjust scope or phasing with the sponsor
B) Continue as planned, since the visa rules are a matter for the government
C) Cancel the programme immediately, since enrolments will fall
D) Ask the marketing department to recruit more domestic students
= A
? External changes that affect demand change the business case. The sponsor decides on adjustments based on an updated assessment.

@@ BE8 | Predictive
The operating system used by the plant's control servers will lose vendor support next year. What should the project manager do?
A) Plan an upgrade or replacement, and assess the risks until it is complete
B) Keep the current system, since it works well and has never failed in fifteen years
C) Disconnect the servers from the network permanently to avoid risk
D) Wait until the support has ended before deciding what to do
= A
? Technology obsolescence is a predictable external change. Planning ahead avoids running critical systems without security updates.

@@ BE8 | Hybrid
After an accident at another chemical plant, local residents demand more information about Halden's safety. What should the project do?
A) Engage the community proactively about the upgrade and its safety measures
B) Avoid public statements until the media interest in the other accident has died down
C) Refer all questions to the regulator, since the regulator is responsible for public safety
D) Release detailed technical drawings of the plant so that residents can judge for themselves
= A
? Social factors, such as public concern, are part of the business environment. Proactive, clear engagement builds trust.
